@startuml
title State diagram of the system operations of "Process Sale"

[*] --> WaitingCustomer

state "Waiting for customer" as WaitingCustomer
state "Record items" as RecordItems
state "Waiting for payment" as WaitingPayment

WaitingCustomer --> RecordItems : enter item
RecordItems --> RecordItems : enter item
RecordItems --> WaitingPayment : end of sale

WaitingPayment --> CardOrCheck : card or check payment
CardOrCheck --> PaymentVerified : approved payment
CardOrCheck --> CashPayment : cash payment
CardOrCheck --> RejectedPayment : rejected payment

WaitingPayment --> WaitingCustomer : finished payment (for cash)
WaitingPayment --> EndOfSale : end of sale (for cash)
EndOfSale --> [*] : return to waiting for next customer

@enduml
